        "body": "Context : git localized in french, gitea running normally. \n`tea clone [my repo] `\nfails with error \n`Error: git rev-parse --show-toplevel: fatal: ni ceci ni aucun de ses répertoires parents n'est un dépôt git : .git`\n..meanwhile \n`LANG=en_GB LC_ALL=en_GB LANGUAGE=en_GB tea clone [my repo]`\nworks as appropriate. \nI can't confirm the fix, but the analysis and the diff look good. \nSince pretty much any work starts with a tea clone, this bug prevents any non-english localized git user to start working right away...  ",
